         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introdução\n\nQuando saímos de casa para ir a um parque, a uma escola ou a um mercado, normalmente voltamos depois.\n\nNas aulas anteriores, aprendemos a imaginar os números crescendo em uma estrada, sempre caminhando para onde eles aumentam. Nesta aula, aprendemos a caminhar de volta.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "eaf6bd4e-9f68-4945-ae49-1e4e46321975",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "eaf6bd4e-9f68-4945-ae49-1e4e46321975",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "3918f1d9-8d7f-439f-8f76-e5c4ef741b5e",
               "text": "Weisstein, Eric W.",
               "page": "https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Axis.html",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Relembrando os Eixos\n\nLembremos a estrada que construímos com alguns números marcados nela. Chamamos essa estrada de **eixo**.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg width=\"450\" height=\"100\"  fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"> <defs> <marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"> <path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" /></marker> </defs> <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"15\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" /> <text x=\"0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">0</text> <text x=\"40\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">1</text> <text x=\"80\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">2</text> <text x=\"120\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">3</text> <text x=\"160\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">4</text> <text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">5</text> <text x=\"240\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">6</text> <text x=\"280\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">7</text> <text x=\"320\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">8</text> <text x=\"360\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">9</text> <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"45\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"85\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"85\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"125\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"165\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"205\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"205\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"245\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"285\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"285\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"325\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"325\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"365\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" />  </svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Gráfico 1: Representação de um eixo com números. Os números são colocados abaixo da linha, e uma seta na extremidade direita indica a direção em que os números crescem.</b></p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "c2dc5fb2-cd6a-4f9b-ac6f-9a7386dacc79",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "c2dc5fb2-cd6a-4f9b-ac6f-9a7386dacc79",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Caminhando Cinco Passos\n\nPartindo do 0, cinco passos para a direita exigem dois cálculos que já conhecemos:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "| Somando | Multiplicando |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 = 5 | 5 × 1 = 5 |",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": true,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Tabela 1: Representação dos cinco passos por meio da matemática.*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "02246a91-2cb8-4fcf-aa5c-9c678ce57e96",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "02246a91-2cb8-4fcf-aa5c-9c678ce57e96",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "nerd",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "ad7733f8-38ad-406f-abee-d259e45bf383",
               "text": "Weisstein, Eric W.",
               "page": "https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Subtraction.html",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2010",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Uma Nova Operação\n\nQuando caminhamos para longe do ponto de partida, precisamos medir essa distância. Já sabemos somar ou multiplicar os passos. Agora apresentamos a **subtração**, que mede a diferença entre dois números.\n\nNos nossos 5 passos:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"text-align=center\"><center>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5<br />-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;0<br />____________<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5</center></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Cálculo 1</b>: Número de passos desde a origem.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "f5d92755-a0ce-4cef-9b98-e391041950fd",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "f5d92755-a0ce-4cef-9b98-e391041950fd",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### De Volta à Origem\n\nAgora imagine que terminamos no destino, 5 passos a partir da origem, e voltamos o mesmo número de passos. Chegamos de novo à origem — e podemos mostrar isso com uma subtração:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"text-align=center\"><center>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5<br />-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5<br />____________<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;0</center></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Cálculo 2</b>: Retorno à origem.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "918c12d2-a14b-4686-abad-7d6b536e5668",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "918c12d2-a14b-4686-abad-7d6b536e5668",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "shocking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### De Outro Ponto de Partida\n\nAgora suponha que começamos na posição 1 e paramos na posição 9. Para contar os passos, subtraia 1 de 9:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"text-align=center\"><center>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;9<br />-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1<br />____________<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8</center></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Cálculo 3</b>: Número de passos entre duas posições.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "e1253c1d-a5bd-4e5e-82f1-66890737e4c2",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "e1253c1d-a5bd-4e5e-82f1-66890737e4c2",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Vamos Pensar!\n\nPodemos ler o sinal de menos como voltar por um eixo?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "2487e133-e610-426f-aacb-695ee1c5d6c4",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "2487e133-e610-426f-aacb-695ee1c5d6c4",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "nerd",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Um Sinal para Retornar\n\nOlhemos as duas subtrações que fizemos. Em 5 − 5 = 0 o resultado é menor que o valor de partida, então voltamos ao longo do eixo. A subtração 9 − 1 = 8 é diferente: é a distância da posição 1 até a posição 9, e ir de 1 a 9 é avançar ao longo do eixo.\n\nO sinal de menos (−) indica mudar de direção, enquanto o sinal de mais (+), na adição, nos faz avançar no mesmo eixo.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "6221f0f6-b47e-4d93-8138-2a243b2c3cc7",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "6221f0f6-b47e-4d93-8138-2a243b2c3cc7",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "party",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusão\n\nNesta aula conhecemos uma nova operação: a **subtração**. Usamos para medir distâncias e comprimentos, e ela pode indicar o retorno a uma posição anterior.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      }
   ]
